References and credits
----------------------

Saldima for iPhone is an independent implementation. It is not a fork of, and
contains no code copied from, the projects below.

- GnuCash (https://www.gnucash.org) — the file format, accounting model and
  desktop application this product is compatible with. GnuCash is licensed
  under GPL-2.0-or-later. Used as a behavioural reference only; no GnuCash code
  is linked into Saldima or shipped to users.
- gnucash-web (https://github.com/joshuabach/gnucash-web) — a GPLv3 reference
  for screens and scope. Behavioural reference only; no code copied.
- piecash (https://pypi.org/project/piecash) — a GPLv3 Python library.
  Behavioural reference only; no code copied.
- python3-gnucash — GPL bindings that run only in the web project's isolated
  CI oracle and converter container, never in this app.

The name "GnuCash" is a trademark of the GnuCash project. Saldima uses it only
to describe compatibility.

Dependencies bundled with Saldima must be MIT, BSD, Apache-2.0, ISC, 0BSD or
CC0; CI enforces this.
